    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to this fantastic summer camp!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will spend the next 3 days doing various activities, exploring the area and above all, learning about various LGBTQ+ issues during your stay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the varied activities that the camp offers, such as a game of scavenger hunt, archery or the talks that take place every night around the campfire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450890/extras/369e16a9f487aaeaab6a2b2ed97eaff4.poster.avif?t=1741091742\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450890/extras/369e16a9f487aaeaab6a2b2ed97eaff4.webm?t=1741091742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450890/extras/369e16a9f487aaeaab6a2b2ed97eaff4.mp4?t=1741091742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore the different areas of the camp and take the opportunity to talk, interact and get to know your fellow campers better. How you respond in your interactions can influence the outcome of your experience.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450890/extras/6dfb5fb033ac355b47d44f9445bc5700.poster.avif?t=1741091742\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450890/extras/6dfb5fb033ac355b47d44f9445bc5700.webm?t=1741091742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450890/extras/6dfb5fb033ac355b47d44f9445bc5700.mp4?t=1741091742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>LGBTQ+ themes and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The camp will bring up a wide variety of LGBTQ+ issues related to sexuality, gender, phobias and more that will lead you to learn about them in order to better relate to the camp.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450890/extras/e913021ff6b19c05131188b8a7590a1f.poster.avif?t=1741091742\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450890/extras/e913021ff6b19c05131188b8a7590a1f.webm?t=1741091742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450890/extras/e913021ff6b19c05131188b8a7590a1f.mp4?t=1741091742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to this fantastic summer camp!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will spend the next 3 days doing various activities, exploring the area and above all, learning about various LGBTQ+ issues during your stay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the varied activities that the camp offers, such as a game of scavenger hunt, archery or the talks that take place every night around the campfire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450890/extras/369e16a9f487aaeaab6a2b2ed97eaff4.poster.avif?t=1741091742\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450890/extras/369e16a9f487aaeaab6a2b2ed97eaff4.webm?t=1741091742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450890/extras/369e16a9f487aaeaab6a2b2ed97eaff4.mp4?t=1741091742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore the different areas of the camp and take the opportunity to talk, interact and get to know your fellow campers better. How you respond in your interactions can influence the outcome of your experience.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450890/extras/6dfb5fb033ac355b47d44f9445bc5700.poster.avif?t=1741091742\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450890/extras/6dfb5fb033ac355b47d44f9445bc5700.webm?t=1741091742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450890/extras/6dfb5fb033ac355b47d44f9445bc5700.mp4?t=1741091742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>LGBTQ+ themes and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The camp will bring up a wide variety of LGBTQ+ issues related to sexuality, gender, phobias and more that will lead you to learn about them in order to better relate to the camp.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450890/extras/e913021ff6b19c05131188b8a7590a1f.poster.avif?t=1741091742\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450890/extras/e913021ff6b19c05131188b8a7590a1f.webm?t=1741091742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450890/extras/e913021ff6b19c05131188b8a7590a1f.mp4?t=1741091742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "You're going to spend 3 days at summer camp! Explore the camp, do camp activities and get to know your fellow campers as you learn about LGBTQ+ issues and more in this storytelling adventure. But, a dark secret awaits",
